SUMMARY:IEEE CEC 2027 · Conference
DESCRIPTION:IEEE Congress on Evolutionary Computation\nStatus: confirmed\, 
 checked 2026-10-31\nOfficial source: https://ieeecec.org/2027\nVenue Rada
 r: https://gon-uri.github.io/venue-radar/#ieee-cec-2027\nNotes: Official 
 CEC 2027 pages (checked 2026-10-31) confirm the EICC\, Edinburgh\, Jul 25
 -28. Full papers (8 pages\, double-anonymous\, incl. special-session pape
 rs) are due Feb 28 with no hour stated (provisional AoE end of day) and g
 o to IEEE Xplore\; 4-page short papers are due Mar 15\, 23:59 AoE\, prese
 nted as posters in a separate Companion Proceedings. Both say no extensio
 n. The FAQ gives a Sep 1\, 2026 submission opening\; EDAS needs login\, s
 o not verified. The CFP PDF gives Nov 15 for session/workshop proposals\,
  web pages Nov 29. The student-only GSS and journal-only J2C calls are sc
 hedule-only. Size L basis: 443 of 751 papers accepted in 2013\; no recent
  counts. Size is an editorial estimate.
CATEGORIES:Evolutionary Computation & Optimization,Machine Learning
URL:https://ieeecec.org/2027
